| Sync: as Test, but each picture's bulk transfer is waited for as it
| arrives (as MMALDecode did) instead of running on while the next one
| comes (-S). Reports to ResultSync.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultSync
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -S -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultSync <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -S -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultSync <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -S -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultSync <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
